{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"What this connection has spent over a period: requests, tokens, cache savings and the total in rubles. Same as GET /v1/usage. With an API key that is the key's spending; connected through OAuth, it is the spending of the whole app connection over the period, not just of the current hourly token.\n\nUse it to report what a run cost, to check spending against a budget, or to see the charge of tools that do not return their own price (image_generate, speech_create). balance_get shows what is left on the account.\n\nFree to call: it only reads.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"period":{"description":"Period: \"today\", \"24h\" (default), \"7d\", \"30d\" or \"mtd\" \u2014 month to date. All times in UTC.","enum":["today","24h","7d","30d","mtd"],"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"usage_get","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"buckets":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bucket":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"cost_kopecks":{"type":"string"},"cost_rub":{"type":"number"},"requests":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["bucket","cost_rub","cost_kopecks","requests"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}]},"by_key":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cost_kopecks":{"type":"string"},"key_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"key_prefix":{"type":["string","null"]},"name":{"type":["string","null"]},"requests":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"total_tokens":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["key_id","key_prefix","name","requests","total_tokens","cost_kopecks"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}]},"by_model":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"addit